<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>内推 - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E5%86%85%E6%8E%A8/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E5%86%85%E6%8E%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>在大疆做测试开发是一种什么体验？</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/test-dev-in-dji/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/test-dev-in-dji/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Growth/">Growth</category><description>&lt;p&gt;提到测试开发这个岗位，可能有的人会有些陌生，都听说过软件测试和软件开发，但测试开发又是干什么的呢？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;说到这里，我又想起之前在阿里移动事业群的一件趣事儿。当时也是做测试开发岗位，我所在的组在公司内部有一个响当当的名号，“牲畜组”，生产力促进组嘛。有的同事更直接，亲切地叫我们组为”畜牲组“，促进生产力组的简称。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>